<title>USA: Banque Nationale de Paris (NY) sets debt.</title>
<headline>Banque Nationale de Paris (NY) sets debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Banque Nationale de Paris (New York branch) was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANQUE NATIONALE DE PARIS (NEW YORK BRANCH)</p>
<p>AMT $350 MLN	 COUPON 7.20 PCT   MATURITY 01/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.742  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 7.237 PCT   PAY FREQ	 N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 73 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
